.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Interstitial working files agents and operators produce while running a process
# (setup reports, change proposals, bootstrap summaries, deck sources, scratch drafts).
# Never permanent records, never committed.
tmp/*
!tmp/.gitkeep
# Files under docs/ stay local until an operator explicitly adds one to this repository.
docs/**
!docs/README.md
!docs/AGENTS.md
!docs/build-any-ai-application.md
